{
  "source": "video-audit/avoid-opener-v12-2026-11-11/edited.wav",
  "duration": 138.4333125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.74,
      "text": "The underlying architecture that makes artificial intelligence so capable at generating language"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.74,
      "end": 10.04,
      "text": "and images is the exact same machinery that causes it to fail."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.84,
      "end": 12.56,
      "text": "These failures are highly predictable."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.12,
      "end": 15.46,
      "text": "They happen in specific, repeating patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.3,
      "end": 19.82,
      "text": "The real danger for the user is the complete lack of friction."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.68,
      "end": 24.8,
      "text": "When a language model hallucinates, you don't get a flashing red light or an error code."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.16,
      "end": 31.24,
      "text": "A completely fabricated statistic arrives with absolute certainty and a highly authoritative tone."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.92,
      "end": 36.92,
      "text": "A conversational assistant wraps incorrect answers in polite, flattery and smooth pacing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.32,
      "end": 40.32,
      "text": "making the mistake feel psychologically satisfying to read."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.1,
      "end": 46.52,
      "text": "A synthetic image or a cloned voice mimics physical reality so precisely that your eyes"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.52,
      "end": 48.4,
      "text": "and ears naturally accept it as truth."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.92,
      "end": 53.04,
      "text": "To understand how this deception works, we need to step away from digital interfaces"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.04,
      "end": 54.66,
      "text": "and look at the physical world."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.72,
      "end": 57.14,
      "text": "Think about a coastal rip current."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.78,
      "end": 60.4,
      "text": "To the untrained eye, this doesn't look like a hazard."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.94,
      "end": 65.8,
      "text": "A calm, flat channel situated right between breaking waves looks like the most inviting"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.8,
      "end": 66.54,
      "text": "place to swim."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.14,
      "end": 73.54,
      "text": "But that smooth surface is actually masking a powerful, concentrated column of water moving"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.54,
      "end": 75.26,
      "text": "in the exact opposite direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.9,
      "end": 81.14,
      "text": "If you step into that calm water, the current will quickly and quietly pull you far away"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.14,
      "end": 81.68,
      "text": "from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.0,
      "end": 87.74,
      "text": "The actual survival skill is identifying the specific shape of the hazard before your feet"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.74,
      "end": 88.42,
      "text": "leave the sand."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.78,
      "end": 94.52,
      "text": "Professional lifeguards spot these traps constantly because they are trained to recognize the visual"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.52,
      "end": 97.1,
      "text": "signature of that suspiciously calm water."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.94,
      "end": 102.22,
      "text": "Interacting with artificial intelligence requires this exact same preventative mindset."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.86,
      "end": 108.02,
      "text": "The technology has its own digital rip currents, and safely utilizing these tools means"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.02,
      "end": 112.08,
      "text": "recognizing their specific shapes before you get pulled into the deception."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.84,
      "end": 115.54,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.3,
      "end": 119.1,
      "text": "Why can AI sound so sure and still be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.84,
      "end": 121.92,
      "text": "When might I be trusting AI too much?"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.46,
      "end": 127.52,
      "text": "If AI can create convincing fakes, what should I check before trusting what I see or hear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.12,
      "end": 130.5,
      "text": "When AI fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.2,
      "end": 133.22,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
